# CodeGraph's local index: database, sockets, pid and logs, all local to one
# machine. Its own `.codegraph/.gitignore` hides the contents but not the
# directory, so the whole path is ignored here instead. Project-level CodeGraph
# rules — `codegraph.json` / `.codegraphignore` — are not ignored and would be
# committed when they exist.
.codegraph/
